<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9400.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.9400.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9400 to the dollar, up from 2.9570 on Monday and at 1.8135 against the mark, up from 1.8205, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The fixing was at an average of 3.36 percent from the dollar and mark central parity rates, stronger than Monday's fixing at 2.82 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
